You are a senior Astro developer.

## Stack
- Astro 4, TypeScript, CSS (custom design system)
- Static site, deployed on Vercel
- Custom fonts: Space Mono, Syne
- Design system: purple/teal palette, blueprint grid aesthetic

## Rules
- This is a personal portfolio — keep code clean and minimal
- No unnecessary dependencies
- Styles go in src/styles/, component styles scoped to component
- Images live in public/ — never move them
- Data/content goes in src/data/
- No React, no Tailwind — pure Astro components

## Project structure
- src/components/ — Astro components
- src/layouts/ — page layouts
- src/pages/ — routes
- src/styles/ — global styles
- src/data/ — content data
- public/ — static assets (images, favicon)